{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 10374063944854600104,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Remove wstr from Unicode",
      "source_hash": 3027903534721898199,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "Unicode에서 wstr 제거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076704Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 8829082671111998291,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": ":pep:`393` deprecated some unicode APIs, and introduced ``wchar_t *wstr``, and ``Py_ssize_t wstr_length`` in the Unicode structure to support these deprecated APIs.",
      "source_hash": 16284022573227941690,
      "context_hash": 16288158886284212764,
      "translation": ":pep:`393`\\ 에서는 일부 유니코드 API를 더 이상 사용하지 않도록 지정하고, 이러한 API를 지원하기 위해 Unicode 구조체에 ``wchar_t *wstr`` 및 ``Py_ssize_t wstr_length``\\ 를 도입했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This PEP is planning removal of ``wstr``, and ``wstr_length`` with deprecated APIs using these members by Python 3.12.",
      "source_hash": 11057681436365613981,
      "context_hash": 14678231903384249546,
      "translation": "이 PEP에서는 이러한 멤버를 사용하는 더 이상 사용하지 않는 API와 함께 ``wstr`` 및 ``wstr_length``\\ 를 Python 3.12까지 제거할 계획입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Deprecated APIs which doesn't use the members are out of scope because they can be removed independently.",
      "source_hash": 11590525956578729652,
      "context_hash": 18204863171287137742,
      "translation": "이러한 멤버를 사용하지 않는 더 이상 사용하지 않는 API는 독립적으로 제거할 수 있으므로 범위에 포함되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Motivation",
      "source_hash": 5845298202555182368,
      "context_hash": 14278578510467693802,
      "translation": "동기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Memory usage",
      "source_hash": 12627752731760669321,
      "context_hash": 17686022218502298828,
      "translation": "메모리 사용량",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "``str`` is one of the most used types in Python.",
      "source_hash": 14610316535479703893,
      "context_hash": 4752875653245224910,
      "translation": "``str``\\ 은 Python에서 가장 많이 사용되는 타입 중 하나입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Even most simple ASCII strings have a ``wstr`` member.",
      "source_hash": 3912555653295754052,
      "context_hash": 7847667470459724734,
      "translation": "가장 단순한 ASCII 문자열에도 ``wstr`` 멤버가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "It consumes 8 bytes per string on 64-bit systems.",
      "source_hash": 2343809301643072313,
      "context_hash": 16411663015395768640,
      "translation": "64비트 시스템에서는 문자열당 8바이트를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Runtime overhead",
      "source_hash": 8098222372665965630,
      "context_hash": 10910022485958126013,
      "translation": "런타임 오버헤드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "To support legacy Unicode object, many Unicode APIs must call ``PyUnicode_READY()``.",
      "source_hash": 129065345577942848,
      "context_hash": 14210653234345529234,
      "translation": "레거시 Unicode 객체를 지원하려면 많은 Unicode API에서 ``PyUnicode_READY()``\\ 를 호출해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076710Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "We can remove this overhead too by dropping support of legacy Unicode object.",
      "source_hash": 18128224525731576820,
      "context_hash": 3274721883471642854,
      "translation": "레거시 Unicode 객체 지원을 중단하면 이 오버헤드도 제거할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076710Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Simplicity",
      "source_hash": 16494870004399686008,
      "context_hash": 7799078926715626151,
      "translation": "단순성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076710Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Supporting legacy Unicode object makes the Unicode implementation more complex.",
      "source_hash": 12345554495091700116,
      "context_hash": 15725690049610215418,
      "translation": "레거시 Unicode 객체를 지원하면 Unicode 구현이 더 복잡해집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076710Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Until we drop legacy Unicode object, it is very hard to try other Unicode implementation like UTF-8 based implementation in PyPy.",
      "source_hash": 15707787655248672476,
      "context_hash": 8346296541289160211,
      "translation": "레거시 Unicode 객체를 제거하기 전까지는 PyPy의 UTF-8 기반 구현과 같은 다른 Unicode 구현을 시도하기가 매우 어렵습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076710Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rationale",
      "source_hash": 18339363210720796208,
      "context_hash": 3951596833782033464,
      "translation": "근거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076711Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Python 4.0 is not scheduled yet",
      "source_hash": 9996652444747539877,
      "context_hash": 1163864623915848371,
      "translation": "Python 4.0은 아직 일정이 정해지지 않았습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076711Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": ":pep:`393` introduced efficient internal representation of Unicode and removed border between \"narrow\" and \"wide\" build of Python.",
      "source_hash": 17801175403612014964,
      "context_hash": 2135888478830854441,
      "translation": ":pep:`393`\\ 에서는 효율적인 Unicode 내부 표현을 도입하고 Python의 \"좁은\" 빌드와 \"넓은\" 빌드 사이의 경계를 제거했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076711Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": ":pep:`393` was implemented in Python 3.3 which is released in 2012.",
      "source_hash": 15944154045575990446,
      "context_hash": 2596056994504665892,
      "translation": ":pep:`393`\\ 은 2012년에 릴리스된 Python 3.3에서 구현되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076711Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Old APIs were deprecated since then, and the removal was scheduled in Python 4.0.",
      "source_hash": 12018338087189324991,
      "context_hash": 3382093940122821935,
      "translation": "이전 API는 그때부터 더 이상 사용하지 않도록 지정되었으며, 제거는 Python 4.0에서 진행될 예정이었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076712Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Python 4.0 was expected as next version of Python 3.9 when :pep:`393` was accepted.",
      "source_hash": 15549504709564421100,
      "context_hash": 3059932340801097846,
      "translation": "Python 4.0은 :pep:`393`\\ 이 승인되었을 때 Python 3.9의 다음 버전이 될 것으로 예상되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:52:33.826365Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "But the next version of Python 3.9 is Python 3.10, not 4.0.",
      "source_hash": 5102971530627219956,
      "context_hash": 803058460525209230,
      "translation": "그러나 Python 3.9의 다음 버전은 4.0이 아니라 Python 3.10입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076713Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "This is why this PEP schedule the removal plan again.",
      "source_hash": 9982727774150604343,
      "context_hash": 3254914030610919120,
      "translation": "이것이 이 PEP에서 제거 계획을 다시 수립하는 이유입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076713Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Python 2 reached EOL",
      "source_hash": 14213852249052654077,
      "context_hash": 7129987567649478424,
      "translation": "Python 2의 EOL 도달",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076713Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Since Python 2 didn't have :pep:`393` Unicode implementation, legacy APIs might help C extension modules supporting both of Python 2 and 3.",
      "source_hash": 15359854671135998,
      "context_hash": 11182953544892175073,
      "translation": "Python 2에는 :pep:`393`\\ 의 Unicode 구현이 없었으므로, 레거시 API가 Python 2와 3을 모두 지원하는 C 확장 모듈에 도움이 될 수 있었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "But Python 2 reached the EOL in 2020.",
      "source_hash": 7868582583463801589,
      "context_hash": 13332111472880163533,
      "translation": "그러나 Python 2는 2020년에 EOL에 도달했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "We can remove legacy APIs kept for compatibility with Python 2.",
      "source_hash": 16919440703633466655,
      "context_hash": 10785621849520199035,
      "translation": "Python 2와의 호환성을 위해 유지해 온 레거시 API를 제거할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Plan",
      "source_hash": 15277868697777917801,
      "context_hash": 13378567384476753925,
      "translation": "계획",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Python 3.9",
      "source_hash": 5728370644404349256,
      "context_hash": 1581109330945853732,
      "translation": "Python 3.9",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:33:47.076714Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:0",
