    {
      "id": "section:11/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "``PyUnicode_FromUnicode(NULL, size)`` and ``PyUnicode_FromStringAndSize(NULL, size)`` emit ``DeprecationWarning`` when ``size > 0``.",
