      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "``PyArg_ParseTuple()`` and ``PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords()`` emit ``DeprecationWarning`` when ``u``, ``u#``, ``Z``, and ``Z#`` formats are used.",
