    {
      "id": "section:13/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`Draft PEP: Remove wstr from Unicode <https://mail.python.org/archives/list/python-dev@python.org/thread/BO2TQHSXWL2RJMINWQQRBF5LANDDJNHH/#BO2TQHSXWL2RJMINWQQRBF5LANDDJNHH>`_",
      "source_hash": 6384007889583870940,
      "context_hash": 14382393132773294352,
      "translation": "`초안 PEP: Unicode에서 wstr 제거 <https://mail.python.org/archives/list/python-dev@python.org/thread/BO2TQHSXWL2RJMINWQQRBF5LANDDJNHH/#BO2TQHSXWL2RJMINWQQRBF5LANDDJNHH>`_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:22:44.408632Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`When can we remove wchar_t* cache from string? <https://mail.python.org/archives/list/python-dev@python.org/thread/7JVC3IKS2V73K36ISEJAAWMRFN2T4KKR/#7JVC3IKS2V73K36ISEJAAWMRFN2T4KKR>`_",
      "source_hash": 15506652804742354649,
      "context_hash": 2485490509277952852,
      "translation": "`문자열에서 wchar_t* 캐시를 언제 제거할 수 있습니까? <https://mail.python.org/archives/list/python-dev@python.org/thread/7JVC3IKS2V73K36ISEJAAWMRFN2T4KKR/#7JVC3IKS2V73K36ISEJAAWMRFN2T4KKR>`_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:22:44.408632Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`PEP 623: Remove wstr from Unicode object #1462 <https://github.com/python/peps/pull/1462>`_",
